      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\nA music video that moves with the track.\n\nThe camera pushes and drifts in time with the rhythm, holding on the downbeat and gliding through the phrase.\n\nLight pulses with the percussion - practical lamps, reflections and haze flare on the hits and fall back between them.\n\nThe subject performs to the music: weight shifting, head and shoulders answering the beat, hair and fabric carrying the motion.\n\nCinematic, shallow depth of field, volumetric light, film grain.",
